        "Title": "Falling For You",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127873877198",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7ab82bab-c5eb-4d89-a3bd-5e9456233fc0).Image",
        "Description": "47! This mission isn&apos;t important, nor is it urgent. That being said, from this point on I want you to focus all your energy and time on it. CARL INGRAM you&apos;re familiar with. Stupid face, withered hair.. you know the one. Well he recently threw a party I was invited too, where him and his &quot;buddy&quot; MR. RAHMANI coaxed me into a precarious/photographed situation with 3 young ladies. They made me fall for them, now make those two fall for me. Oh, the girls laughed at me.. should probz kill them too!",
